/// Map-local units (`war3map.w3u`) that a shipped chapter places or
/// scripts: `nC08` on Orc01, `nC00` on Prologue01.  `map` is the map file
/// stem; `def.id` stays the chapter's own rawcode so JASS
/// `GetUnitTypeId`/`'nC08'` comparisons keep working.  The row is the
/// install-table base with the map's object-data cells applied -- stats,
/// name, abilities and model/icon inherited from the base.  A rawcode is
/// map-local content: `nC00..nC11` are reused by several chapters with a
/// different base, so `data::map_def_of(map, id)` is the exact lookup and
/// this table's order (Prologue01 first, then Orc01) is the precedence
/// `def_of` uses when an id is shared.
